              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Servees (Service Taxis)"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Servees, or shared service taxis, are a common sight in Qena."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "They offer a more flexible and often faster option than buses for short to medium distances."
