            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Navigating Security Checkpoints"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The security situation in Egypt can be dynamic, and sometimes certain areas may be restricted for foreigners."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "You may encounter police escorts or security checkpoints, especially when traveling outside urban areas."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Allow extra time for potential delays at these checkpoints, as escorts may need to change vehicles."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Travel Tips"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Always stay informed about the current security situation in the region."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Be flexible with your travel plans to accommodate unexpected changes or delays."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Engaging with local guides or tour operators can provide added insight and help in navigating any logistical challenges."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In summary, while traveling around Qena, trains, buses, servees, and taxis offer a range of options to suit different preferences and needs. It’s important to stay aware of the security situation and plan accordingly, allowing extra time for travel and considering the use of local guides or tour operators for a smoother experience."
